  "title": "Boiler Incident Response and Investigation Report",
  "subtitle": "Document immediate response, boiler condition, evidence, notifications, investigation, corrective action, and closure.",
  "description": "A boiler-specific incident record for preserving factual evidence about injury, fire, fuel, combustion, pressure, steam, water, chemical, venting, control, equipment, and service events through accountable resolution.",
  "use_case": "Use after a boiler incident or near miss when the organization needs one traceable record of response, affected people and operations, scene evidence, notifications, cause analysis, corrective action, return-to-service authority, and closure.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
